# Temporary debug/probe scripts (optional, but often generated during dev)
# Note: The prompt asks to ignore based on rules. These are .mjs source-like files. 
# Rule 6 says if ONLY source/config and NO build artifacts/temp -> empty. 
# However, there ARE .log files and profiling outputs (.cpuprofile is a binary/artifact).
# So we must ignore the artifacts.

# CPU Profiles (Binary/Artifact)
*.cpuprofile